 perfect marriage. He wears two wedding rings: one on each hand for each wife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From an old review by Nargrakhan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2040"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a482f8d1eb3d5509b4b3863567c2f7c027229b260a1ec8c9aa9e53a4ab6f7e42.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a908923027f051aa41058d21699c4d91930cd61d382bfa49e2b56dd35efea5f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2041","characterName":"鈴木","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2041"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suzuki is a corporate coworker of Kazuki. While she may appear meek and submissive, Suzuki has an immoral side that has occasionally gotten others in serious trouble. She has always held a secret desire for Kazuki, and those feelings have grown even stronger since his dual marriage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From an old review by Nargrakhan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2041"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6624ec27d9db9c4458744f6fb52edf2fb48f1e216cd7f7bd49d7bd4739c30921.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/chara